{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q410346","formula":"C₉H₇Cl₂N₅","hill":"C9H7Cl2N5","elements":["H","C","N","Cl"],"composition":{"C":9.0,"H":7.0,"N":5.0,"Cl":2.0},"names":{"en":"Lamotrigine","ru":"Ламотриджин","uk":"Ламотригін"},"descriptions":{"en":"Lamotrigine ( luh-MOH-trih-jeen), sold under the brand name Lamictal among others, is a medication used to treat epilepsy and stabilize mood in bipolar disorder. For epilepsy, this includes focal seizures, tonic-clonic seizures, and seizures in Lennox-Gastaut syndrome. In bipolar disorder, lamotrigine has not been shown to reliably treat acute depression in any groups except for the severely depressed; but for patients with bipolar disorder who are not currently symptomatic, it appears to reduce the risk of future episodes of depression.","ru":"Ламотриджи́н — противоэпилептическое лекарственное средство, применяемое при лечении эпилепсии и биполярных расстройств; обладает также нормотимической активностью.","uk":"Ламотригін (також ламотриджин, англ. Lamotrigine, лат. Lamotriginum) — синтетичний лікарський препарат, який є похідним фенілтріазину, та належить до протисудомних препаратів."},"fame":42,"pubchemCid":3878,"mass":256.09,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC(=C(C(=C1)Cl)Cl)C2=C(N=C(N=N2)N)N","inchikey":"PYZRQGJRPPTADH-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"6-(2,3-dichlorophenyl)-1,2,4-triazine-3,5-diamine","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"3878","atoms":23,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.002,"y":2.296,"z":-0.113,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-4.151,"y":1.717,"z":-0.059,"el":"Cl"},{"x":1.274,"y":-0.019,"z":1.33,"el":"N"},{"x":2.801,"y":-0.038,"z":-0.98,"el":"N"},{"x":0.852,"y":-0.416,"z":-2.27,"el":"N"},{"x":2.609,"y":0.163,"z":1.401,"el":"N"},{"x":4.702,"y":0.337,"z":0.346,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.722,"y":-0.394,"z":0.142,"el":"C"},{"x":0.718,"y"